Alder Street Productions has acquired the screenplay &#x201C; Silver Foxes &#x201D; from James Berg and Stan Zimmerman. The deal was made at the American Film Market (AFM).

The writing team&#x2019;s credits include &#x201C; The Golden Girls ,&#x201D; &#x201C;Roseanne&#x201D; and &#x201C; Gilmore Girls .&#x201D;

Adapted by Berg and Zimmerman from their stage play of the same name, &#x201C;Silver Foxes&#x201D; centers on a group of retired friends who build a chosen family in Palm Springs, navigating love, aging and the next chapter together, all while plotting to rescue their best friend from a homophobic assisted living facility. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Skydance Q3 Profit Powered By Studios, Streaming Skydance Sports Chief Gives Top Roles to Jeff Gerttula, Craig Barry

Principal photography is planned for summer 2027 on location in Palm Springs, California. Tony Award-winning and Grammy-nominated producer Cody Lassen will produce for Alder Street.

&#x201C;Stan and Jim have written the kind of comedy that makes you want to pull up a chair and spend time with these characters,&#x201D; said Lassen. &#x201C;&#x2018;Silver Foxes&#x2019; celebrates friendship and the possibilities of a new chapter. It&#x2019;s rooted in Palm Springs&#x2019; gay community, but its story of finding your people can connect with audiences across generations. It&#x2019;s heartfelt and hilarious, which is exactly the kind of film we&#x2019;re excited to make at Alder Street.&#x201D;

The &#x201C;Silver Foxes&#x201D; stage play had its world premiere at Uptown Players in Dallas in March 2023.

Berg and Zimmerman&#x2019;s screen credits also include &#x201C;The Brady Bunch Movie&#x201D; and &#x201C;A Very Brady Sequel.&#x201D; The duo created and executive produced the Lifetime comedy series &#x201C;Rita Rocks&#x201D; and earned Writers Guild of America Award nominations for their work on &#x201C;The Golden Girls&#x201D; and &#x201C;Roseanne.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Lassen&#x2019;s film credits also include Summoning Sylvia, the Artios-winning and GLAAD Media Award-nominated horror-comedy that received a theatrical release and was acquired by Starz and maintains a 100% on Rotten Tomatoes.

The acquisition follows Alder Street&#x2019;s recent sale of &#x201C;Actual Nobodies,&#x201D; written and directed by Alex Wyse and starring Didi Conn and Austin P. McKenzie. Scatena & Rosner Films acquired North American distribution rights at the 2026 Cannes Market, with Media Luna New Films handling international sales for the remaining territories.

I Want Your Sex , starring Olivia Wilde as an artsy dominatrix and Cooper Hoffman as her muse, begins streaming on HBO Max on December 4. The film will premiere on HBO linear the following day, on Saturday, December 5 at 8 p.m. ET. The streaming date marks a 126-day window following its theatrical release on July 31.

